eport. These attempts occurred before the final generated tests were completed, and no post-generation coverage report or `stats`/execution-metrics file exists. The preserved reachability metadata is still `{}`.\n\nLogs to inspect:\n- `logs/io.micronaut.sql:micronaut-jdbc:7.1.0/add-new-library-support/pi-generation-2026-10-02T01-18-00-279067Z.log`\n- `logs/io.micronaut.sql:micronaut-jdbc:7.1.0/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-10-02T01-34-18-262234Z.log`\n- `logs/io.micronaut.sql:micronaut-jdbc:7.1.0/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-10-02T01-35-02-623747Z.log`\n- `logs/io.micronaut.sql:micronaut-jdbc:7.1.0/gradle/generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport-2026-10-02T01-14-33-130309Z.log`\n- `logs/io.micronaut.sql:micronaut-jdbc:7.1.0/gradle/generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport-2026-10-02T01-17-43-117422Z.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Resume from the preserved branch and complete test-generation/finalization using the passing four-test suite.\n2. Cleanly regenerate dynamic-access coverage after the final tests, and determine whether the missing output reflects genuinely zero tracked accesses or a tracing problem.\n3. Populate the missing index URLs, generate metadata and metrics, then run the coordinate-scoped validation and JVM/native test gates.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_070a861bb27c5259016abf0e466ba087d1a5f2f0cc3c9d8dd4\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 6373, "output": 1677, "cacheRead": 227584, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1034, "totalTokens": 235634, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1790905905331, "responseId": "resp_070a861bb27c5259016abf0e31f66487d1942f610dbd671102", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
